          "why": "Heating gives the particles enough energy to leave their fixed positions and move past one another.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify the initial state.\nStep 2: Identify the final state.\nStep 3: A solid changes into a liquid.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Melting.",
          "subject": "chemistry",
