          "why": "Repeated equilibrium between liquid and vapour phases gives better separation.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Liquids with close boiling points are difficult to separate in one vaporisation step.\nStep 2: The column allows repeated vaporisation and condensation.\nStep 3: This enriches the vapour in the more volatile component.\nStep 4: Therefore, separation becomes more effective.",
