          "why": "Each new energy level increases the distance between the nucleus and the outermost electrons.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Moving down a group adds another occupied energy level.\nStep 2: The outer electrons are therefore farther from the nucleus.\nStep 3: The atom becomes larger.",
