      "notes": "<h2>Electron Transfer</h2>\n\n  <p><strong>Electron transfer</strong> occurs when one atom loses electrons and another atom gains them.</p>\n\n  <h3>Sodium and chlorine</h3>\n\n  <p>Sodium:</p>\n  <p>Na = 2,8,1</p>\n\n  <p>Chlorine:</p>\n  <p>Cl = 2,8,7</p>\n\n  <p>Sodium loses one electron:</p>\n\n  <p>Na → Na⁺ + e⁻</p>\n\n  <p>Chlorine gains that electron:</p>\n\n  <p>Cl + e⁻ → Cl⁻</p>\n\n  <p>The resulting Na⁺ and Cl⁻ ions attract to form sodium chloride.</p>",
