            "Step 2: n = 2 mol.",
            "Step 3: Nₐ = 6.02 × 10²³ mol⁻¹.",
            "Step 4: N = 2 × 6.02 × 10²³.",
            "Step 5: N = 12.04 × 10²³.",
            "Step 6: N = 1.204 × 10²⁴ particles."
