          "why": "The balanced equation requires half as many moles of O₂ as H₂.",
          "sol": "Step 1: The equation gives H₂ : O₂ = 2 : 1.\nStep 2: 2 mol H₂ require 1 mol O₂.\nStep 3: 4 mol H₂ is twice 2 mol.\nStep 4: Therefore, oxygen required = 2 mol.",
