      "notes": "<h2>Calculating Product Amount</h2>\n\n  <p>The coefficients in a balanced equation can be used to calculate the amount of product formed.</p>\n\n  <h3>Example</h3>\n\n  <p>N₂ + 3H₂ → 2NH₃</p>\n\n  <p>The ratio is:</p>\n\n  <p>1 mol N₂ → 2 mol NH₃</p>\n\n  <p>Therefore, 4 mol N₂ produce:</p>\n\n  <p>4 × 2 = 8 mol NH₃</p>",
