          "why": "The balanced equation shows that two moles of ammonia are produced per mole of nitrogen.",
          "sol": "Step 1: N₂ : NH₃ = 1 : 2.\nStep 2: 1 mol N₂ produces 2 mol NH₃.\nStep 3: 4 mol N₂ produces 4 × 2 mol NH₃.\nStep 4: NH₃ = 8 mol.",
