          "sol": "Step 1: Identify the state symbol.\nStep 2: (s) represents a solid.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of State Symbols.",
          "subject": "chemistry",
          "chapter": "chemical_reactions",
          "topic": "State Symbols",
          "conceptId": "chemistry_chemical_reactions_state_symbols",
