          "why": "Two HCl molecules provide two chlorine atoms for MgCl₂ and two hydrogen atoms for H₂.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Magnesium = Mg.\nStep 2: Hydrochloric acid = HCl.\nStep 3: Magnesium chloride = MgCl₂.\nStep 4: Hydrogen = H₂.\nStep 5: Balance the chlorine and hydrogen atoms.",
