          "steps": [
            "Step 1: The aim is to use up all the acid.",
            "Step 2: Excess insoluble base remains as a solid.",
            "Step 3: The excess can be removed by filtration."
          ],
          "why": "This prevents excess acid from contaminating the salt solution.",
          "sol": "Step 1: The aim is to use up all the acid.\nStep 2: Excess insoluble base remains as a solid.\nStep 3: The excess can be removed by filtration.",
