          "why": "The catalyst is regenerated during the catalytic process.",
          "sol": "Step 1: A catalyst participates in the reaction pathway.\nStep 2: It is regenerated rather than permanently consumed.\nStep 3: Therefore it can continue to catalyse further reaction.",
