          "q": "A reaction has an activation energy of 100 kJ mol⁻¹. A catalyst provides an alternative pathway requiring 60 kJ mol⁻¹. By how much has the activation energy been reduced?",
          "ans": "40 kJ mol⁻¹",
          "type": "text",
