          "why": "Rusting requires both oxygen and water.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Iron must have access to oxygen.\nStep 2: Iron must also have access to water.\nStep 3: Therefore both oxygen and water are required.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Rusting.",
          "subject": "chemistry",
          "chapter": "metals_extraction",
          "topic": "Rusting",
          "conceptId": "chemistry_metals_extraction_rusting",
          "skillId": "chemistry_metals_extraction",
