          "sol": "Step 1: But-2-ene contains a carbon-carbon double bond.\nStep 2: Rotation around the double bond is restricted.\nStep 3: Each double-bonded carbon has two different groups attached to it.\nStep 4: The groups can therefore occupy different fixed spatial arrangements.\nStep 5: But-2-ene can therefore exist as cis and trans forms.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Geometric Isomerism.",
