          "why": "The filter traps solid particles while water passes through.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify the type of impurity filtration removes.\nStep 2: Filtration separates insoluble solid particles from a liquid.\nStep 3: Therefore, filtration removes suspended insoluble particles.",
