          "why": "Both gases contribute to the greenhouse effect.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Recall gases that absorb infrared radiation.\nStep 2: Carbon dioxide is a greenhouse gas.\nStep 3: Methane is also a greenhouse gas.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Greenhouse Effect.",
          "subject": "chemistry",
