          "why": "Cu²⁺ forms blue copper(II) hydroxide with hydroxide ions.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Cu²⁺ reacts with OH⁻ ions.\nStep 2: Copper(II) hydroxide is formed.\nStep 3: Copper(II) hydroxide is blue.",
