          "why": "Only collisions satisfying the required energy and orientation conditions can produce products.",
          "sol": "Step 1: A collision must provide enough energy to overcome the reaction barrier.\nStep 2: The particles must also have a suitable orientation.\nStep 3: A collision lacking either requirement is unsuccessful.",
