          "why": "A fuel with a high calorific value may still be unsuitable if it is expensive, unsafe, unavailable or highly polluting.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Consider the environmental effects of combustion.\nStep 2: Consider practical factors such as cost, availability or safety.\nStep 3: Therefore, fuel selection should consider more than energy output.",
