          "sol": "Step 1: Aluminium is very reactive.\nStep 2: Aluminium oxide is too stable to be effectively reduced by carbon.\nStep 3: Electrolysis supplies electrical energy to reduce aluminium ions.\nStep 4: Aluminium metal is therefore obtained at the cathode.",
